code: 0
--- stdout
A closed issue is needed after all

  From:      any status
  To:        Backlog; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Reopen:    reopens a closed issue

Usage:
  gh dojo revive <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for revive
--- stderr
